<!--
  libmisfix's settings, installed beside the dylib at /usr/lib/libmisfix.plist.

  Shipped empty. The hook's signature behaviour needs no configuration, and the
  device-identity behaviour stays off until a UDID is set here.

  UniqueDeviceID  A device already registered with your team, e.g.
                  00008150-000815E014B8401C. misagent answers its MobileGestalt
                  query with this instead of the guest's own UDID, so that
                  team's provisioning profiles install on this VM without the
                  VM being added to the account.

                  Only processes carrying the hook see it. What Xcode,
                  devicectl and lockdown report is unchanged and still the
                  guest's own UDID — TXM builds that one from the device tree
                  before the kernel runs. See
                  Research/Guest/xcode_install_signature_gate.md.
-->
